{"allContent":{"docusaurus-plugin-css-cascade-layers":{},"docusaurus-plugin-content-docs":{"default":{"loadedVersions":[{"versionName":"current","label":"Next","banner":null,"badge":false,"noIndex":false,"className":"docs-version-current","path":"/docs","tagsPath":"/docs/tags","editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs","isLast":true,"routePriority":-1,"sidebarFilePath":"/Users/resitdc/Documents/projects/resitdc/indonesia-programming-language/documentation/sidebars.ts","contentPath":"/Users/resitdc/Documents/projects/resitdc/indonesia-programming-language/documentation/docs","docs":[{"id":"dasar/fungsi","title":"Fungsi (Functions)","description":"Ketika menulis program yang panjang, kita sering kali mendapati diri kita mengetik baris kode yang sama berulang-ulang di tempat yang berbeda. Hal ini membuat kode kita menjadi berantakan, sulit dibaca, dan sulit diperbaiki jika ada kesalahan.","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/05-fungsi.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/fungsi","permalink":"/docs/dasar/fungsi","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/05-fungsi.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":5,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":5},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Perulangan (Looping)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/perulangan"},"next":{"title":"Struktur Data Kompleks","permalink":"/docs/dasar/tipe-data"}},{"id":"dasar/operator","title":"Operator Dasar","description":"Setelah Anda membuat Variabel, Anda tentu ingin melakukan perhitungan atau manipulasi terhadap nilai di dalamnya. Rakoda menyediakan kumpulan Operator yang sangat mudah diingat karena 100% menggunakan bahasa Indonesia untuk logika utamanya.","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/02-operator.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/operator","permalink":"/docs/dasar/operator","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/02-operator.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":2,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":2},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Variabel","permalink":"/docs/dasar/variabel"},"next":{"title":"Percabangan (Logika)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/percabangan"}},{"id":"dasar/percabangan","title":"Percabangan (Logika)","description":"Percabangan adalah cara sebuah program mengambil keputusan. Dalam dunia nyata, kita sering berpikir: \"Jika hari ini hujan, maka saya akan membawa payung.\"","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/03-percabangan.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/percabangan","permalink":"/docs/dasar/percabangan","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/03-percabangan.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":3,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":3},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Operator Dasar","permalink":"/docs/dasar/operator"},"next":{"title":"Perulangan (Looping)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/perulangan"}},{"id":"dasar/perulangan","title":"Perulangan (Looping)","description":"Dalam pemrograman, kita sering kali perlu melakukan tugas yang sama berulang kali. Misalnya, mencetak tulisan \"Halo\" sebanyak 100 kali. Bukankah sangat melelahkan jika kita harus mengetiknya satu per satu?","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/04-perulangan.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/perulangan","permalink":"/docs/dasar/perulangan","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/04-perulangan.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":4,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":4},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Percabangan (Logika)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/percabangan"},"next":{"title":"Fungsi (Functions)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/fungsi"}},{"id":"dasar/tipe-data","title":"Struktur Data Kompleks","description":"Sejauh ini, Anda telah belajar cara menyimpan angka atau teks ke dalam sebuah variabel. Namun, bagaimana jika Anda ingin menyimpan daftar nama siswa dalam satu kelas? Jika jumlah siswanya ada 30, apakah Anda akan membuat 30 variabel yang berbeda?","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/06-tipe-data.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/tipe-data","permalink":"/docs/dasar/tipe-data","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/06-tipe-data.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":6,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":6},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Fungsi (Functions)","permalink":"/docs/dasar/fungsi"},"next":{"title":"Pustaka Standar (Stdlib)","permalink":"/docs/category/pustaka-standar-stdlib"}},{"id":"dasar/variabel","title":"Variabel","description":"Dalam bahasa pemrograman Rakoda, Anda dapat menyimpan data ke dalam sebuah \"wadah\" yang disebut sebagai variabel.","source":"@site/docs/01-dasar/01-variabel.md","sourceDirName":"01-dasar","slug":"/dasar/variabel","permalink":"/docs/dasar/variabel","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/01-dasar/01-variabel.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":1,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":1},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Dasar Pemrograman","permalink":"/docs/category/dasar-pemrograman"},"next":{"title":"Operator Dasar","permalink":"/docs/dasar/operator"}},{"id":"ekosistem/manajemen-paket","title":"Manajemen Paket (Package Manager)","description":"Ketika Anda membuat proyek besar, sering kali Anda tidak ingin membuat semuanya dari nol. Anda ingin mengunduh kode (Pustaka/Modul) yang sudah dibuat oleh programmer lain di internet dan memakainya di proyek Anda.","source":"@site/docs/05-ekosistem/20-manajemen-paket.md","sourceDirName":"05-ekosistem","slug":"/ekosistem/manajemen-paket","permalink":"/docs/ekosistem/manajemen-paket","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/05-ekosistem/20-manajemen-paket.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":20,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":20},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Menjalankan Kode (Perintah CLI)","permalink":"/docs/ekosistem/perintah-cli"}},{"id":"ekosistem/perintah-cli","title":"Menjalankan Kode (Perintah CLI)","description":"Sejauh ini Anda telah mempelajari cara menulis kode bahasa Rakoda ke dalam sebuah file berekstensi .rpl. Namun, bagaimana cara mengeksekusi file tersebut agar programnya benar-benar menyala?","source":"@site/docs/05-ekosistem/19-perintah-cli.md","sourceDirName":"05-ekosistem","slug":"/ekosistem/perintah-cli","permalink":"/docs/ekosistem/perintah-cli","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/05-ekosistem/19-perintah-cli.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":19,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":19},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Ekosistem & Tooling","permalink":"/docs/category/ekosistem--tooling"},"next":{"title":"Manajemen Paket (Package Manager)","permalink":"/docs/ekosistem/manajemen-paket"}},{"id":"fitur-lanjut/kecerdasan-buatan","title":"Kecerdasan Buatan (AI)","description":"Sebenarnya modul Kecerdasan Buatan (ai) sudah sempat kita singgung secara singkat di Bab 11, namun karena fitur ini sangat luar biasa dan lengkap, ia pantas mendapatkan bab khususnya sendiri!","source":"@site/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/16-kecerdasan-buatan.md","sourceDirName":"04-fitur-lanjut","slug":"/fitur-lanjut/kecerdasan-buatan","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/kecerdasan-buatan","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/16-kecerdasan-buatan.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":16,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":16},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Tugas Latar Belakang & Log Server","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/tugas-dan-log"},"next":{"title":"Penanganan Error (Try-Catch)","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/penanganan-error"}},{"id":"fitur-lanjut/modul-dan-import","title":"Modul & Pemecahan Kode","description":"Ketika Anda mulai membuat aplikasi yang besar, menulis ribuan baris kode di dalam satu file bernama main.rpl bukanlah ide yang bagus. File tersebut akan menjadi sangat panjang, berantakan, dan sulit diperbaiki.","source":"@site/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/18-modul-dan-import.md","sourceDirName":"04-fitur-lanjut","slug":"/fitur-lanjut/modul-dan-import","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/modul-dan-import","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/18-modul-dan-import.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":18,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":18},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Penanganan Error (Try-Catch)","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/penanganan-error"},"next":{"title":"Ekosistem & Tooling","permalink":"/docs/category/ekosistem--tooling"}},{"id":"fitur-lanjut/penanganan-error","title":"Penanganan Error (Try-Catch)","description":"Saat program Anda berjalan di dunia nyata, banyak hal tidak terduga bisa terjadi. Misalnya:","source":"@site/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/17-penanganan-error.md","sourceDirName":"04-fitur-lanjut","slug":"/fitur-lanjut/penanganan-error","permalink":"/docs/fitur-lanjut/penanganan-error","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/resitdc/rakoda-programming-language/tree/main/documentation/docs/04-fitur-lanjut/17-penanganan-error.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":17,"frontMatter":{"sidebar_position":17},"sidebar":"tutorialSidebar","previous":{"title":"Kecerdasan Buatan (AI)","permalink":"/d